{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1362.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"5dca78920656301cacc7c741391a5680e7d62383d2ab9c1962506886d20fad3a","ja":"あっ、静香ちゃん。おはよう～！","zh":"啊，静香。早上好～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1362.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"28f58cafa49ed9f39f3811ebe5ae1955bfaefad124d53e2b4ae2ff70304d0954","ja":"ふふっ♪　おはよう、可奈♪","zh":"呵呵♪　早上好，可奈♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1362.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"7c15259a486aae73f72c2ae4cbb12e49c79e41a9ac6d2b19f7795ff342809e92","ja":"あれっ？　静香ちゃん、なんだかうれしそうだね！\nなにかいいことでもあったの？","zh":"哎？静香，你看起来好像挺开心的呢！\n是遇到什么好事了吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1362.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"ac7178d521e37fec2537da433dc7291b9d8802b99b5faaffa6b61d60291cca78","ja":"うん、そうなの。「最近、姿勢がよくてダンスにも\nキレがある」って、さっき先生に褒められて♪","zh":"嗯，是呀。刚才老师夸我“最近姿势很端正，\n跳舞也利落有劲”呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1362.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"f74357609a07032757ff16aeb2d3798d41f1e787f1cc489f7cf29f6ee4020257","ja":"静香ちゃんもなんだ！\n私もこの前、同じことを褒めてもらったよ♪","zh":"静香也是吗！\n我前阵子也因为同一件事被夸了哦♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1362.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"fcb5f74feb18706ef996fb88b3d5f1bc100555968449f013a111904e0d0d99f3","ja":"そうなの？　それじゃあやっぱり、映画の撮影前に\nやった、淑女の礼儀作法や姿勢の特訓のお陰なのかも。","zh":"是这样吗？那果然多亏了在电影开拍前\n特训过的淑女礼仪以及站姿坐姿吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1362.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"d004aee98c702be6909fdd308374f99e90b496308c9cc86137f03875c6b2c347","ja":"きっとそうだよ！　この調子で、\nもっとダンスがうまくなれたらいいのにな～♪","zh":"一定是这样！要是能照这个势头，\n跳舞跳得更好就好了呢～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1362.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"92cc5da83792dfa8e8c85d3fb75c4c2cb1b659a11c36bab9d26ea6538c33c22c","ja":"それなら……淑女についてもっと学べば、\nダンスがもっとうまくなれるんじゃないかしら？","zh":"既然这样……如果更多地去了解淑女，\n舞会不会跳得更好一些呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1362.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"dbb5471d929dcb65992fde8d55e2ee0de5c793bd48bb33e11c08554ccc58fd40","ja":"なるほど……！\nナイスアイディアだね、静香ちゃん♪","zh":"原来如此……！\n真是个好主意呢，静香♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1362.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"a225df7012128ce2824c1309ba23da7a08b36230896120ebb03d602be1dbad9d","ja":"ふふ、ありがとう、可奈。じゃあもう1回、\n伊織さんに淑女の特訓をお願いしてみましょう。","zh":"呵呵，谢谢你，可奈。那我们就再拜托\n伊织小姐进行1次淑女特训吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1362.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"69be17179dde78cfb5b9a12329254372318147101e40b087021928cd23ede1a4","ja":"うん！　そうと決まれば……\n私、伊織さんを探してくるね！","zh":"嗯！既然决定好了……\n我去把伊织找来哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1362.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"9000fdbd2c742c3af4ec144e49e23813b598146827fa34cd27c36e74c05db4e4","ja":"あっ。待って、可奈！\n私も一緒に行くから！","zh":"啊。等等，可奈！\n我也一起去！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
